{
  "contract": "sync-prices",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "What the computer answers to POST /v1/prices for one instrument the phone reports, given what it stores. Shared with the mobile client, which applies the answers: pending changes nothing and asks again later; full replaces every row of the instrument; tail deletes the rows at or after `from` and writes `rows`. Instants are compared as instants, whatever offset they are written in.",
